    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Store Keeper \u2014 a game where you take on the role of a large wholesale warehouse manager!</strong><br>Your task is to establish a seamless logistics operation: from receiving goods from suppliers to delivering them to retail stores. Smart inventory management, precise calculations, and efficient space organization will help you build a warehouse that runs like clockwork.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Receiving and Inspecting Shipments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/95c1cd41f35030fa963d77af5b959e4c.poster.avif?t=1752656466\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/95c1cd41f35030fa963d77af5b959e4c.webm?t=1752656466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/95c1cd41f35030fa963d77af5b959e4c.mp4?t=1752656466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Monitor incoming goods, check invoices, and identify supplier errors. Decide how to handle defective or surplus products. Every decision impacts your reputation and profits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Optimizing Warehouse Space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/f687e4102736cf26f0778b9c8f20bbaf.poster.avif?t=1752656466\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/f687e4102736cf26f0778b9c8f20bbaf.webm?t=1752656466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/f687e4102736cf26f0778b9c8f20bbaf.mp4?t=1752656466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Arrange products strategically to speed up shipments and minimize losses. Upgrade warehouse facilities and organize storage areas for maximum efficiency.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Maintaining Proper Storage Conditions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/6592d755dfd5769c98468a2d2191795e.poster.avif?t=1752656466\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/6592d755dfd5769c98468a2d2191795e.webm?t=1752656466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/6592d755dfd5769c98468a2d2191795e.mp4?t=1752656466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Certain products require special storage conditions: refrigerated goods must be kept in cooling chambers, while dry goods should be stored in well-ventilated areas. Manage warehouse resources wisely to streamline storage and shipping processes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Order Analysis and Inventory Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track store demands, forecast trends, and prevent stock shortages or overflows. Plan purchases strategically to keep your warehouse profitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you build the perfect logistics system and become a true master of warehouse management? Test your skills in <strong>Store Keeper!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Store Keeper \u2014 a game where you take on the role of a large wholesale warehouse manager!</strong><br>Your task is to establish a seamless logistics operation: from receiving goods from suppliers to delivering them to retail stores. Smart inventory management, precise calculations, and efficient space organization will help you build a warehouse that runs like clockwork.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Receiving and Inspecting Shipments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/95c1cd41f35030fa963d77af5b959e4c.poster.avif?t=1752656466\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/95c1cd41f35030fa963d77af5b959e4c.webm?t=1752656466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/95c1cd41f35030fa963d77af5b959e4c.mp4?t=1752656466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Monitor incoming goods, check invoices, and identify supplier errors. Decide how to handle defective or surplus products. Every decision impacts your reputation and profits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Optimizing Warehouse Space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/f687e4102736cf26f0778b9c8f20bbaf.poster.avif?t=1752656466\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/f687e4102736cf26f0778b9c8f20bbaf.webm?t=1752656466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/f687e4102736cf26f0778b9c8f20bbaf.mp4?t=1752656466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Arrange products strategically to speed up shipments and minimize losses. Upgrade warehouse facilities and organize storage areas for maximum efficiency.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Maintaining Proper Storage Conditions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/6592d755dfd5769c98468a2d2191795e.poster.avif?t=1752656466\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/6592d755dfd5769c98468a2d2191795e.webm?t=1752656466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500830/extras/6592d755dfd5769c98468a2d2191795e.mp4?t=1752656466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Certain products require special storage conditions: refrigerated goods must be kept in cooling chambers, while dry goods should be stored in well-ventilated areas. Manage warehouse resources wisely to streamline storage and shipping processes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Order Analysis and Inventory Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track store demands, forecast trends, and prevent stock shortages or overflows. Plan purchases strategically to keep your warehouse profitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you build the perfect logistics system and become a true master of warehouse management? Test your skills in <strong>Store Keeper!</strong></p>",
